    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <strong>Digi-Gears</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate deck in this 3D, turn-based, stylish voxel strategy game.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique and rare Digi-Gears as you travel to many distinct locations on your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel various opponents and meet memorable characters on your journey to master the game! Collect accolade points by competing in Digi-Gear tournaments spread throughout the region. Earn enough points and enter the championship where you will get a chance to face off against the reigning champions. <strong>Ready to dive into the world of Digi-Gears? Go on, pick your starter deck and let's go!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <strong>Digi-Gears</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/60e4dec888d7084665b678237c1210a1.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate deck in this 3D, turn-based, stylish voxel strategy game.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/0462dff549a9a59f5927b2b08c93c82c.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique and rare Digi-Gears as you travel to many distinct locations on your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/f7a17ce78d97cc3ce7aa940176e02168.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel various opponents and meet memorable characters on your journey to master the game! Collect accolade points by competing in Digi-Gear tournaments spread throughout the region. Earn enough points and enter the championship where you will get a chance to face off against the reigning champions. <strong>Ready to dive into the world of Digi-Gears? Go on, pick your starter deck and let's go!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.poster.avif?t=1749390897\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.webm?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683550/extras/bc54d7831922dbc59d24d12ee69d6a39.mp4?t=1749390897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
